Kokoro-82M
Copyright (c) hexgrad

This directory contains a redistributed copy of the Kokoro-82M text-to-speech
model and its voice style embeddings.

Upstream sources
----------------
- Model weights and voicepacks: https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M (v1.0)
- G2P / tokenizer: https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
- License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE.md in this directory)

ONNX conversion
---------------
The ONNX graph and the packed voice format follow the conversion tooling from
https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx (MIT). That project's own code is
MIT-licensed; the Kokoro model weights and voice data remain Apache-2.0 and are
redistributed here under Apache-2.0.

Changes from upstream
---------------------
- PyTorch checkpoint converted to ONNX (model.onnx).
- Voice style embeddings extracted from the voicepacks and stored as raw
  float32 arrays (voices/*.bin).
- Tokenizer files repackaged for local ONNX inference.

